cases
requirement	case	module	access program	error	reason	output	diagnostic	assertion
hook-output.7	1	hook output	context					an event answer members gives is answered as one JSON object holding its value at each pointer: continue true on beforeSubmitPrompt
hook-output.8	1	hook output	context					an event neither answer members nor context members gives is answered by nothing
hook-output.1	1	hook output	context					where the event begins the context, the context is the data bank's names, then what is new to the session and agent, each value then its records of _stored
hook-output.4	1	hook output	context					what is new beyond the context limit is cut to the last whole values it holds, every value still marked communicated
hook-output.5	1	hook output	context					on every other event the context is empty, and the event is answered by nothing
hook-output.6	1	hook output	context					the context is MTSV text written by the generator
